# Real experimental data and anything derived from it -- never commit real
# single-cell / CRISPR screen data or objects built from it. Only synthetic
# fixtures (tests/validation/ground_truth.json, built from hand-constructed
# rnorm() matrices with a fixed seed -- see scripts/dump_r_ground_truth.R)
# belong in this repo.
tests/validation/moi5_real/
tests/validation/*.log
*.rds

# scratch/output (real discovery-result exports, benchmark output, etc.)
*.csv

# Local copies of real screen data pulled from GCS for validation/benchmarking.
# Never commit these -- see the note above.
test_data/

# Docker build output
docker/build.log
docker/build_push.log

# Built docs site (mkdocs build); the published copy comes from Actions.
site/
